title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/newspaper.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and radio.

= Media

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> runs a veritable media empire, with many newspapers throughout every German city and region. We could use the media for various purposes...

- @campaign
- @lachaven
- @lachaven_2
- @radical
- @radical_2
- @ideological
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@campaign
title: The purpose of our media is to elect more <span style="color: #2b2673;">Reformists</span>.
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_lwusp += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_lwusp += 1*(1 - dissent); new_middle_lwusp += 2*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 1*(1 - dissent); bluds_lwusp += 1*(1 - dissent); workers_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent) if radical_relation >= 4; unemployed_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent) if radical_relation >= 4; new_middle_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent) if lachaven_relation >= 4; old_middle_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent) if lachaven_relation >= 4; bluds_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent) if radical_relation >= 4

[? if lachaven_relation < 4 and radical_relation < 4 : Our campaign's effectiveness is greatly hampered by the lack of a clear voter base. ?][? if lachaven_relation >= 4 : Our campaign is mostly reaching our already saturated voter base, consisting of the middle classes. Still, it must be doing *something*. ?][? if radical_relation >= 4 : Our campaign is mostly reaching our already saturated voter base, consisting of the workers and the unemployed. Still, it must be doing *something*. ?]

@lachaven
title: Strengthen our ties with the Lachaven Times.
subtitle: This will strengthen our liberal faction and define our voter base more clearly.
view-if: lachaven_relation < 5
on-arrival: lachaven_relation += 1; liberal_strength += 6; pro_republic += 3; nationalism -= 2; new_middle_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent)

We have made an important step in defining our voter base. The middle classes are more likely to support us.

@lachaven_2
title: Make the Lachaven Times our official newspaper.
subtitle: This will finally give us a way to fully express our views to our voter base.
view-if: lachaven_relation = 5
choose-if: liberal_strength >= 50 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if liberal_strength < 50 : The liberals don't hold enough influence. ?][? if resources < 1 : Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: lachaven_relation += 1; liberal_strength += 10; left_dissent += 5; pro_republic += 5; new_middle_lwusp += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 5*(1 - dissent); new_middle_pfjp -= 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_pfjp -= 3*(1 - dissent)

The Lachaven Times will be our official newspaper from now on.

@radical
title: Strengthen our ties with the Radical.
subtitle: This will strengthen our liberal faction and define our voter base more clearly.
view-if: lachaven_relation < 5
on-arrival: radical_relation += 1; left_strength += 6; socialism += 3; nationalism -= 2; workers_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent)

We have made an important step in defining our voter base. The workers and unemployed are more likely to support us.

@radical_2
title: Make the Radical our official newspaper.
subtitle: This will finally give us a way to fully express our views to our voter base.
view-if: radical_relation = 5
choose-if: left_strength >= 50 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if left_strength < 50 : The left doesn't hold enough influence. ?][? if resources < 1 : Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: radical_relation += 1; left_strength += 10; liberal_dissent += 5; socialism += 5; workers_lwusp += 5*(1 - dissent); unemployed_lwusp += 5*(1 - dissent); workers_cps -= 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_cps -= 3*(1 - dissent)

The Radical will be our official newspaper from now on.

@ideological
title: We will have vibrant ideological debate within our newspapers.
subtitle: There will be space for all factions to air their views.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 6; liberal_dissent -= 6; moderate_dissent -= 6

This has been our media course historically, and it has successfully paved over the many tensions in our party.

@radio
title: Why not fund a radio station?
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 2; new_middle_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_lwusp += 2*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1 - dissent);  nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)

Our new radio station allows us to connect to people in a more intimate setting than before, spreading the message of <span style="color: ;">reformism</span> along with music and other popular content.

@radio_2
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_lwusp += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)

Our new radio network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success.

@radio_3
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: It is now financially self-sufficient, and does not require any more resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5
on-arrival: radio += 1; new_middle_lwusp += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent); workers_lwusp += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_lwusp += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)

Our radio network has become a successful tool for spreading our message.

@radio_4
title: We should keep on supporting our radio network.
subtitle: As radio becomes more common, the novelty is beginning to wear off, and radio is becoming saturated in society. -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 9
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_lwusp += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_lwusp += 3*(1 - dissent); rural_lwusp += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_lwusp += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 1*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)

We are continuing to invest in our radio stations. Both commercial and political radio are becoming more prevalent, making it harder to spread our message amidst the competition.
